                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A walking simulator that traded actual horror for an endurance test of listening to endless, dramatic audio logs in pitch-black hallways. You wander around a abandoned orphanage looking for smartphone voices like a paranormal ghost hunter on a budget, only to realize the real jump scare is trying to figure out where the actual gameplay went. It is a gloriously bizarre piece of early-2010s creepypasta history packed with top-tier voice acting, zero combat, and enough ambient creaking to make you second-guess every shadow in your own living room.",
